|Case|:group_messaging
```
CLASS GroupManager:
    FUNCTION post_message(group_name, sender, message):
        APPEND message to messages.txt:
            {"group_name": group_name, "sender": sender, "message": message}
        RETURN True

ROUTE /messages/<group_name>:
    IF NOT logged in: REDIRECT to login
    IF POST request:
        GET message from form
        CALL post_message(group_name, current_user, message)
        REDIRECT back to messages
    READ all messages from messages.txt
    FILTER messages for current group
    RENDER messages.html with filtered messages
```

